# VLM Academy - Comprehensive QA Audit Report

**Date:** 2026-02-16  
**Auditor:** Senior QA Engineer & Developer  
**App Version:** v2.0  
**Total Issues Found:** 50+

---

## 🔴 CRITICAL ISSUES (Must Fix Immediately)

### 1. **Missing Routes for New Screens**
**Severity:** CRITICAL  
**Impact:** Users cannot navigate to 8 major screens

**Missing Routes:**
- `/profile-setup` - ProfileSetupScreen
- `/settings` - SettingsScreen
- `/notifications` - NotificationsScreen
- `/student/video-player` - VideoPlayerScreen
- `/student/exam-portal` - ExamPortalScreen
- `/student/test-result` - TestResultScreen
- `/student/rewards` - RewardsCenterScreen
- `/teacher/content-upload` - ContentUploadScreen

**Fix:** Add all missing routes to [app_routes.dart](file:///C:/Users/Pearl%20Organisation/Desktop/desktop/VLM-Academy/lib/core/routes/app_routes.dart)

---

### 2. **Hardcoded Navigation Path**
**Severity:** CRITICAL  
**Location:** `splash_screen.dart:65`

```dart
Navigator.pushReplacementNamed(context, '/onboarding'); // ❌ Hardcoded
```

**Issue:** Uses hardcoded string instead of `AppRoutes.onboarding`  
**Fix:** Use `AppRoutes.onboarding` constant

---

### 3. **Empty Provider Files**
**Severity:** CRITICAL  
**Impact:** No state management functionality

**Files:**
- [auth_provider.dart](file:///C:/Users/Pearl%20Organisation/Desktop/desktop/VLM-Academy/lib/providers/auth_provider.dart) - Only placeholder comment
- [learning_provider.dart](file:///C:/Users/Pearl%20Organisation/Desktop/desktop/VLM-Academy/lib/providers/learning_provider.dart) - Only placeholder comment
