- [wallet_provider.dart](file:///C:/Users/Pearl%20Organisation/Desktop/desktop/VLM-Academy/lib/providers/wallet_provider.dart) - Only placeholder comment

**Fix:** Implement actual provider logic with ChangeNotifier

---

### 4. **No Data Persistence**
**Severity:** CRITICAL  
**Impact:** User data lost on app restart

**Missing:**
- SharedPreferences integration
- User session management
- Login state persistence
- Onboarding completion flag
- User role storage

**Fix:** Implement SharedPreferences service

---

### 5. **Mock Data Everywhere**
**Severity:** CRITICAL  
**Impact:** App shows fake data, not production-ready

**Locations:**
- All dashboard screens
- Test results (hardcoded scores)
- Wallet balances
- Leaderboard rankings
- Notifications

**Fix:** Implement proper data layer with repositories

