## 🟠 HIGH PRIORITY ISSUES

### 6. **No Error Handling**
**Severity:** HIGH  
**Impact:** App crashes on errors

**Missing:**
- Try-catch blocks in async functions
- Network error handling
- Form validation error display
- API error responses
- Null safety checks

---

### 7. **Navigation Stack Issues**
**Severity:** HIGH  
**Location:** Multiple screens

**Issues:**
- Using `Navigator.push()` instead of named routes
- No back button handling
- Inconsistent navigation patterns
- Missing route arguments validation

**Examples:**
```dart
// ❌ Bad
Navigator.push(context, MaterialPageRoute(...))

// ✅ Good
Navigator.pushNamed(context, AppRoutes.screenName, arguments: {...})
```

---

### 8. **Missing Form Validation**
**Severity:** HIGH  
**Locations:**
- [login_screen.dart](file:///C:/Users/Pearl%20Organisation/Desktop/desktop/VLM-Academy/lib/ui/auth/login_screen.dart) - Phone validation incomplete
- [profile_setup_screen.dart](file:///C:/Users/Pearl%20Organisation/Desktop/desktop/VLM-Academy/lib/ui/auth/profile_setup_screen.dart) - Missing field validations
- [content_upload_screen.dart](file:///C:/Users/Pearl%20Organisation/Desktop/desktop/VLM-Academy/lib/ui/teacher/content_upload_screen.dart) - No file size checks

**Issues:**
- Phone number format not validated
- Email validation missing
- No max file size limit
