## ✅ RECOMMENDED FIX PRIORITY

### Phase 1: Critical Fixes (Week 1)
1. Add all missing routes
2. Implement providers with real state management
3. Add SharedPreferences for data persistence
4. Fix hardcoded navigation
5. Implement basic error handling

### Phase 2: High Priority (Week 2)
6. Add form validation everywhere
7. Fix navigation stack issues
8. Implement video player functionality
9. Fix exam timer logic
10. Add loading states

### Phase 3: Medium Priority (Week 3-4)
11. Implement offline support
12. Add accessibility features
13. Fix memory leaks
14. Add search functionality
15. Implement pull-to-refresh

### Phase 4: Polish (Week 5+)
16. Fix all bugs
17. Add analytics
18. Improve code quality
19. Add comprehensive testing
20. Performance optimization

